/T (        Each in-person laboratory module is structured to advance the central hypothesis through a distinct experimental layer, contributing evidence that builds toward the overarching collaborative research paper. Conceptual understanding also extends beyond the bench through the free online Research Track courses, which prepare students to perform protocols confidently, strengthen data interpretation skills, and provide tools for independent scientific exploration.)
