956 0 obj
<<
/Title (Cellular Research Track is the first fully flexible research program that allows you to completely customize your learning path: choosing your own hours and the laboratory experimentation you wish to complete. Designed to cultivate researchers prepared for the biotech landscape, participants generate professional scientific data and publication-quality figures while investigating real medical challenges. These findings are ultimately synthesized into a collaborative research manuscript, earning participants verified technical badges and co-authorship recognition. Within the Cellular Research Track, each of the 4-months explores progressively deeper layers of the same central hypothesis, building a comprehensive understanding of how the biological pathway operates.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 945 0 R
>>
